# ReentrantLock
## 1. ReentrantLock的使用
ReentrantLock 是 `java.util.concurrent.locks` 包中的可重入互斥锁，基于 AQS 实现，功能比 synchronized 更丰富。
### 1.1 基本用法：lock/unlock
```java
import java.util.concurrent.locks.ReentrantLock;
public class ReentrantLockBasicDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock();
private int count = 0;
public void increment() {
lock.lock(); // 获取锁
try {
count++;
} finally {
lock.unlock(); // 必须在 finally 中释放锁！
}
}
public int getCount() {
lock.lock();
try {
return count;
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
}
}
```
### 1.2 可重入性
```java
/**
* ReentrantLock 是可重入锁：同一线程可以多次获取同一把锁
*/
public class ReentrantDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock();
public void methodA() {
lock.lock();
try {
System.out.println("methodA, holdCount = " + lock.getHoldCount());
methodB(); // 同一线程再次获取锁
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
}
public void methodB() {
lock.lock();
try {
System.out.println("methodB, holdCount = " + lock.getHoldCount());
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
}
// 输出：
// methodA, holdCount = 1
// methodB, holdCount = 2
}
```
### 1.3 tryLock — 非阻塞获取锁
```java
/**
* tryLock：尝试获取锁，无论成功失败都立即返回
*/
public class TryLockDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock();
public void tryDoSomething() {
if (lock.tryLock()) {
try {
System.out.println(Thread.currentThread().getName() + " 获取到锁");
// 执行业务逻辑
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
} else {
System.out.println(Thread.currentThread().getName() + " 未获取到锁，执行其他逻辑");
// 获取锁失败，可以做其他事情
}
}
}
```
### 1.4 tryLock 带超时
```java
/**
* tryLock(timeout, unit)：在指定时间内等待获取锁
*/
public class TryLockTimeoutDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock();
public void doWithTimeout() throws InterruptedException {
// 尝试在 5 秒内获取锁
if (lock.tryLock(5, TimeUnit.SECONDS)) {
try {
System.out.println("获取到锁，执行业务逻辑");
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
} else {
System.out.println("等待超时，未获取到锁");
}
}
}
```
### 要点
- `lock()`：阻塞获取锁，不可中断
- `lockInterruptibly()`：阻塞获取锁，可中断
- `tryLock()`：非阻塞，立即返回 true/false
- `tryLock(time, unit)`：带超时的阻塞获取
- `unlock()`：释放锁，**必须在 finally 中调用**
## 2. 公平锁与非公平锁
```java
// 非公平锁（默认）
ReentrantLock unfairLock = new ReentrantLock(); // 等价于 new ReentrantLock(false)
// 公平锁
ReentrantLock fairLock = new ReentrantLock(true);
```
### 2.1 非公平锁
```java
/**
* 非公平锁：新来的线程可以直接"插队"尝试获取锁
* 优点：减少线程切换开销，吞吐量大
* 缺点：可能导致某些线程长时间等待（饥饿）
*/
public class UnfairLockDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock(false); // 非公平
public void access() {
lock.lock();
try {
System.out.println(Thread.currentThread().getName() + " 获取到锁");
Thread.sleep(100);
} catch (InterruptedException e) {
e.printStackTrace();
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
}
}
```
### 2.2 公平锁
```java
/**
* 公平锁：按照等待时间的先后顺序获取锁（FIFO）
* 优点：不会饥饿
* 缺点：需要维护队列顺序，吞吐量较低
*/
public class FairLockDemo {
private final ReentrantLock lock = new ReentrantLock(true); // 公平
public void access() {
lock.lock();
try {
System.out.println(Thread.currentThread().getName() + " 获取到锁");
Thread.sleep(100);
} catch (InterruptedException e) {
e.printStackTrace();
} finally {
lock.unlock();
}
}
}
```
### 2.3 公平锁与非公平锁的源码差异
```java
// 非公平锁的 tryAcquire
protected final boolean tryAcquire(int acquires) {
return nonfairTryAcquire(acquires);
}
final boolean nonfairTryAcquire(int acquires) {
final Thread current = Thread.currentThread();
int c = getState();
if (c == 0) {
// 直接 CAS 尝试获取锁，不管队列中有没有等待的线程
if (compareAndSetState(0, acquires)) {
setExclusiveOwnerThread(current);
return true;
}
}
// ... 可重入逻辑
}
// 公平锁的 tryAcquire
protected final boolean tryAcquire(int acquires) {
final Thread current = Thread.currentThread();
int c = getState();
if (c == 0) {
// 先检查队列中是否有等待的线程（hasQueuedPredecessors）
if (!hasQueuedPredecessors() && compareAndSetState(0, acquires)) {
setExclusiveOwnerThread(current);
return true;
}
return false;
}
// ... 可重入逻辑
}
```
### 要点
- **非公平锁**：新线程直接尝试 CAS 获取锁，失败才入队。吞吐量高，但可能饥饿
- **公平锁**：先检查队列中有没有等待的线程，有则入队。保证 FIFO，但性能较低
- 默认使用非公平锁，绝大多数场景推荐使用非公平锁
